WEBVTT

00:35:59.340 --> 00:36:02.101
One example is the city of Xiongan,

00:36:02.125 --> 00:36:04.403
which is the size of Chicago,

00:36:04.427 --> 00:36:06.672
a brand new city being built,

00:36:06.696 --> 00:36:09.331
and it has autonomous vehicles

00:36:09.355 --> 00:36:12.077
being a part of the design
of the whole city.

00:36:12.101 --> 00:36:17.969
CA: So it's been noticeable, in the US,
there's a growing sense of concern

00:36:17.993 --> 00:36:20.848
about possible loss of competitive
position vis-à-vis China.

00:36:20.872 --> 00:36:23.369
Maybe this is partly
because of your book, Kai-Fu --

00:36:23.393 --> 00:36:25.093
(Laughs) I don't know.

00:36:25.117 --> 00:36:28.717
How does this not end badly?

00:36:28.741 --> 00:36:31.472
I mean, you're talking about technology